ger. There was one saxophonist, played tenor, from Harlem: Ed [? ] - he didn't continue on. He was good. Then they started getting some younger players in the band. They got a younger trombone player from New Orleans, who's still playing. His hair is white now. He's younger than I am. Emery Thompson, his name  ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q5939$E64D98B5-F533-479B-BE60-BAF7B4B36AD2", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "eac3937d81bae9ad41d6a309eb418ab39e13ec0f", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/d2d2f0855ed7ab603676e951a4fa571c/266.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q5939$C15FB52A-6CA7-4DE3-B132-5543862AF8F6", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "768e8ef63871c85265acc1a76316ad19804e59e2", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 25, "id": "Q25"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q5939$1F9E74E6-EDF8-4FFE-BD40-C2E9BF07EAAB", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "d6c14863d903ee485fea10696538379cd16d9975", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 408, "id": "Q408"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q5939$77C0BD2F-F2D8-4559-81A3-47B013932288", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "5d991fae42b2408d0cd8cf85e478d2f6a398efd3", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 456, "id": "Q456"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q5939$FD5028CD-3B78-4407-9779-3589268C7411", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "4962374b9b61d424dfce49846d93b4ab71aef038", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id